#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059776 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059585 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a 2x2 System of Equations Using Gaussian Elimination"}] :question/id #uuid "1eea81be-26d7-57dd-a622-d66300de7f4f" :question/math-academy-id "e-4698" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n![](images/7b/7b1adc08164fdcf1a5322b4fbfd3e5b0f57e22e018aa801add4bb3b572c29f76.svg)\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n![](images/87/8773defc4db521e846b58b7c5ef04b54f26723d94099c75caffbeca0587c33dc.svg)\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 5 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 5\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1} & :=-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -5 & -5 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 5\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -5 & -5 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 10\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=-{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -5 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -10\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n![](images/45/455dc49a531a371ea8aecd6259a677c8006bb2a23181ed66d27721135f240c89.svg)\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=-10$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx-5(-10)=-5 \n\t\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\n\tx=-55.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-55$ and $y=-10.$ Or, in vector form, $\\langle -55,-10 \\rangle.$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050765}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186528050 :question-generator/id #uuid "8e9a709c-6e5b-5a97-91b4-ba52a160d409" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186059776.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059970 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a 2x2 System of Equations Using Gaussian Elimination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "54d5f843-4ed3-5887-9c95-95e2ab4681b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=-4$ and $y=1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238787} {:answer/id #uuid "7de11345-85da-5f42-b994-6f906dd8da2a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=-8$ and $y=2$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239148} {:answer/id #uuid "f40df186-7531-5bdd-8ab8-d17a11d47079" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=-2$ and $y=2$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240208} {:answer/id #uuid "f48c21ea-c0d4-54c8-a868-f917ea05e21f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=-4$ and $y=1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240213} {:answer/id #uuid "fe7498cd-1b74-5e0a-8a1b-90249b213ceb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=-2$ and $y=2$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240309}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f40df186-7531-5bdd-8ab8-d17a11d47079" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=-2$ and $y=2$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240208} :answer-field/id #uuid "152de6d8-6293-59b3-9855-412f2fd00d72" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240362}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "2b3048cb-22e8-56e6-a26a-e3ac30e078b0" :question/math-academy-id "q-10522" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y &=-8 \\\\ 2x+4y &=4.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 10 & 20\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{10}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y &=-8 \\\\ y &=2,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=2$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx-3(2)=-8\\,⇒\\,x=-2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-2$ and $y=2.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060205 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a 2x2 System of Equations Using Gaussian Elimination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "60568eaf-b95e-51a1-b2f3-e1407870bb98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{7}{2} & -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285671} {:answer/id #uuid "97adb96b-8edb-5c4c-902b-ff554ee7b5eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 7 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286170} {:answer/id #uuid "bd5510ff-6cd8-5645-ad15-26672ef4b3e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{7}{2} & -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286517} {:answer/id #uuid "d49177c8-42df-5c93-a6ec-200c5ebaea79" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 7 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286718} {:answer/id #uuid "ee16ef73-bdc4-522a-b8d0-0d85c8d8c09a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{7}{2} & -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286971}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bd5510ff-6cd8-5645-ad15-26672ef4b3e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{7}{2} & -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286517} :answer-field/id #uuid "b6673548-5c1b-50a3-9ea7-bfa5e7f6c3ac" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287527}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a63289e5-22c0-55e8-8542-9af2656af30b" :question/math-academy-id "q-20496" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+7y &=-5 \\\\ 7x+11y &=-4.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 7 & -5 \\\\ 7 & 11 & -4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 7 & -5 \\\\ 7 & 11 & -4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{7}{2} & -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 7 & 11 & -4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-7{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{7}{2} & -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{27}{2} & \\frac{27}{2}\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{2}{27}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{7}{2} & -\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287994 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a 2x2 System of Equations Using Gaussian Elimination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c1aeaeb-0496-5e49-896e-cdf9bcf2c5eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285038} {:answer/id #uuid "469ce16b-f680-51ef-b9d6-1ea50b534cd5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285438} {:answer/id #uuid "99a03cf8-5109-5eb2-a9d0-6200e6c3375b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286195} {:answer/id #uuid "9d06ffa2-8a67-580a-bd64-a76dd2a8fdaf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286223} {:answer/id #uuid "c2a9347a-4d1b-5a30-a05c-454969555819" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286571}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9d06ffa2-8a67-580a-bd64-a76dd2a8fdaf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286223} :answer-field/id #uuid "4ac19391-6295-52b6-9b43-da9d63bae7a6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287309}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "706c95c0-19c0-574d-ac1c-7bbb6eee33bb" :question/math-academy-id "q-20497" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+8y &=22 \\\\ 7x-5y &=4.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & 8 & 22 \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}3 & 8 & 22 \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-7{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{71}{3} & -\\frac{142}{3}\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{3}{71}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287995 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a 2x2 System of Equations Using Gaussian Elimination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0840ea52-a06f-5146-a1df-e3ba124526b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=12$ and $y=-3$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284851} {:answer/id #uuid "832da128-01e8-5583-8f68-dcc408eaf40f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 6\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=9$ and $y=6$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285992} {:answer/id #uuid "9afc9df7-3990-53ba-9bac-8b196b45bd0b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=10$ and $y=3$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286208} {:answer/id #uuid "ea5fd352-814a-5de1-9f20-7c5cff5354f8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 30\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=1$ and $y=30$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286934} {:answer/id #uuid "f09e4410-07cc-50a6-a8e0-bf8048c2a9f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=11$ and $y=0$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286994}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ea5fd352-814a-5de1-9f20-7c5cff5354f8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 30\\end{array}\\right],$\n$\\,x=1$ and $y=30$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286934} :answer-field/id #uuid "29af1eb2-22bf-5eef-a556-f8889e43ec62" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287236}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6bae40ff-f64b-5781-92c2-7de7bf870b94" :question/math-academy-id "q-20500" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+\\frac{1}{3}y &=11 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{5}y &=9.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 3 & \\frac{1}{5} & 9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 3 & \\frac{1}{5} & 9\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{4}{5} & -24\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{5}{4}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 30\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+\\frac{1}{3}y &=11 \\\\ y &=30,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=30$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx+\\frac{1}{3}(30)=11\\,⇒\\,x=11-10=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=1$ and $y=30.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342013 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a 2x2 System of Equations Using Gaussian Elimination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02876a91-9c2b-5db9-93db-3be93af34e6f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339149} {:answer/id #uuid "3d91260d-1cf0-5203-ae2b-cc89655211ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339677} {:answer/id #uuid "9429a5f9-6d54-599b-9687-9203301af7b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340461} {:answer/id #uuid "985c88ff-419b-5caa-bb4e-b32f060129cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340499} {:answer/id #uuid "db9d37bb-2114-5625-ae7e-b79370792765" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -4\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341077}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "02876a91-9c2b-5db9-93db-3be93af34e6f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339149} :answer-field/id #uuid "51dee7b7-d9c0-587e-81fa-5af482e1a393" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341526}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0d942c9d-ca2d-5916-825d-4a4ac9478a87" :question/math-academy-id "q-73555" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4x+12y &=-4 \\\\ 5x+11y &=3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}4 & 12 & -4 \\\\ 5 & 11 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}4 & 12 & -4 \\\\ 5 & 11 & 3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{4}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 11 & 3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-5{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 8\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{1}{4}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186388202 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a 2x2 System of Equations Using Gaussian Elimination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dd4192aa-080e-5c69-8963-a71bb07eb7d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{5}{3} & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388204} {:answer/id #uuid "878deea4-6ebc-5da8-ae3b-6d281a2e7aea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 5 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388205} {:answer/id #uuid "b2059793-db2c-51fa-b66f-2c1fb8c1c72a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{5}{3} & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388206} {:answer/id #uuid "559c34a6-de5d-56ab-b154-9e41f7937767" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{5}{3} & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388207} {:answer/id #uuid "57a47077-35ca-5b6d-be59-4b28fd4d27f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388208}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "559c34a6-de5d-56ab-b154-9e41f7937767" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & \\frac{5}{3} & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388207} :answer-field/id #uuid "4a040579-aefe-533a-8c63-ad19cdf5d7e7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-f